Finally that boring work is finished.
I feel great relief.
I make chai.
I take the mobile and go to the balcony.
Outside, it is raining slowly.
I call my younger sister Sofia, located in Mexico.
I make a video call to her.
"Namaste Maya!"
"Is everything well?" Sofia asks.
"Yes, everything is well."
"Today I am very happy," I say.
I tell her about the boring work on the website.
"Finally my details are updated," I say with a laugh.
"There, everything is written in official language," I add.
She laughs.
"But you usually delay such work," she says.
"True, but you also usually do exactly the same," I say.
"Yes, forms are not filled by us on time," Sofia says.
We both laugh loudly.
Then we talk about family and our dog Lola.
This is a small victory.
But I drink my chai with great satisfaction.
